  "title": "Global-e to Participate in Morgan Stanley US Financials Conference",
  "summary": "PETAH-TIKVA, Israel, June 08, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Global-e Online Ltd. (NASDAQ: GLBE) (“Global-e” or the “Company”), the platform powering global direct-to-consumer e-commerce, today announced that it will participate in the Morgan Stanley US Financials Conference on Tuesday, June 9, 2026.",
